@startuml UML包图
title 外卖点餐与配送系统 —— 包图（分层与依赖方向）
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 16
skinparam ranksep 30
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFD
  BorderColor #2C5F8A
  ArrowColor #4A6B85
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FBF7E8
  BorderColor #E2D6A8
}

package "com.campus.delivery" {

  package "interfaces" as IF {
    [OrderController]
    [CatalogController]
    [AdminController]
  }

  package "application" as APP {
    [OrderAppService]
    [CatalogAppService]
    [DeliveryAppService]
    [StatisticsAppService]
  }

  package "domain" as DOM {
    package "model" as DOM_M {
      [Order]
      [Dish]
      [DailyStock]
      [Refund]
    }
    package "service" as DOM_S {
      [OrderStateMachine]
      [InventoryDomainService]
    }
    package "repository" as DOM_R {
      interface OrderRepository
      interface DishRepository
    }
  }

  package "infrastructure" as INF {
    [OrderRepositoryImpl]
    [DishRepositoryImpl]
    [TimeoutCancelJob]
    [JwtTokenFilter]
  }

  package "common" as COM {
    [BusinessException]
    [ResultCode]
  }
}

IF --> APP : 调用用例
APP --> DOM : 领域对象/服务
APP --> COM
DOM_M --> DOM_S : 状态机校验
DOM_S --> DOM_R : 依赖接口（倒置）
[OrderRepositoryImpl] ..|> OrderRepository : 实现
[DishRepositoryImpl] ..|> DishRepository : 实现
INF --> DOM : 实现仓储、注入
[TimeoutCancelJob] --> APP : 触发用例
[JwtTokenFilter] --> IF : 请求拦截

note right of DOM
  依赖倒置：domain 不依赖
  infrastructure，仓储只声明接口，
  由 infrastructure 实现（可替换、可单测）
end note

note bottom of INF
  定时任务只调用 application 用例，
  不直接写 SQL，保证业务规则唯一
end note

@enduml
